---
---

<section class="statement" id="about">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="statement__identity">
      <p class="statement__word" data-scramble>Designer.</p>
      <p class="statement__word" data-scramble>Developer.</p>
      <p class="statement__word statement__word--dim" data-scramble>Craftsman.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="statement__bio" data-fade-up>
      <p>
        Three years building at Unique Supply have reinforced something I've
        always believed: the best digital products are the ones where
        engineering discipline and design sensibility are inseparable.
      </p>
      <p>
        I don't choose between something that works and something that looks
        beautiful &mdash; I build both. Passionate about the systems behind
        the screen as much as the experience on top of it.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact" class="statement__link">
        Let&rsquo;s build something &nbsp;&rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .statement {
    padding:    var(--section-pad) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .statement > .container {
    display:               grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap:                   clamp(3rem, 8vw, 10rem);
    align-items:           end;
  }

  /* Identity words */
  .statement__identity {
    display:        flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .statement__word {
    font-family:    var(--font-display);
    font-size:      clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    font-weight:    800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height:    1.0;
  }

  .statement__word--dim {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Bio */
  .statement__bio {
    display:        flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap:            1.25rem;
  }

  .statement__bio p {
    font-size:   1rem;
    color:       var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .statement__link {
    display:        inline-block;
    margin-top:     0.5rem;
    font-size:      0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color:          var(--text-muted);
    transition:     color 0.2s;
    border-bottom:  1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
    align-self:     flex-start;
  }

  .statement__link:hover {
    color:        var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .statement > .container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap:                   3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
